# Public values only. This file is committed, and anything given a VITE_ prefix
# is copied into the public site at build time, so it is readable by everyone.
#
# Never put a secret here: no keys, tokens or passwords. Secrets live in Netlify
# environment variables (marked "Contains secret values") and are read only by
# functions under /api/*.
#
# The app needs no environment variables today. A public value would look like:
# VITE_APP_NAME=Split the bill
